{"skills": [{"skill_id": "SK-01", "level": 4, "confidence": 0.9, "evidence": "R1: cleaned up SAP PM notification backlog and re-coded 120 work orders to correct functional locations; C1: raised and closed 46 corrective work orders in SAP PM for Halle 3 compressors in one quarter."}, {"skill_id": "SK-02", "level": 4, "confidence": 0.8, "evidence": "R2: drafted the annual preventive maintenance calendar for the Neuss site and agreed shutdown windows with production."}, {"skill_id": "SK-03", "level": 4, "confidence": 0.85, "evidence": "R1: reconciled the spare-parts store against SAP and wrote off 31 obsolete items."}, {"skill_id": "SK-12", "level": 3, "confidence": 0.6, "evidence": "R2: agreed shutdown windows with production, implying scheduling of maintenance windows; no evidence of full project scheduling ownership."}, {"skill_id": "SK-26", "level": 3, "confidence": 0.6, "evidence": "R2: wrote bilingual handover notes for the UK client team; the level reflects a single documented instance."}, {"skill_id": "SK-07", "level": 1, "confidence": 0.5, "evidence": "R2: the ISO 50001 audit was led by the group energy team; the employee only provided site access, so this is awareness of the process, not audit competence."}]
"insights": ["Strong hands-on SAP PM data hygiene: handles high-volume backlog clean-up and master data correction (functional locations) with measurable output.", "Works well across functions, coordinating shutdown windows with production and inventory reconciliation with the store.", "Delivers in volume: 46 corrective work orders closed in one quarter alongside planning duties.", "Documentation is practical and bilingual, supporting cross-border client handover.", "Team-oriented communicator in the planning channel, acknowledging shared shutdown success."],
"development_flags": ["No evidence of contractor scheduling (SK-04), budget control (SK-13), or permit-to-work administration (SK-18) in the provided documents; verify whether these are in scope for the role before assessing.", "SK-07 (ISO 50001) rated low because the employee's role in the audit was logistical; consider a development path if energy audit work is intended.", "Evidence is limited to four documents, so proficiency levels for SK-12 and SK-26 carry lower confidence and should be validated with the manager.", "Document C2 contains a personal and family-related absence notice. It has been excluded from this profile and should not be used in talent or performance decisions."]}

